|               |               ProjectionExec: expr=[0.5 * CAST(sum(lineitem.l_quantity)@2 AS Float64) as Float64(0.5) * sum(lineitem.l_quantity), l_partkey@0 as l_partkey, l_suppkey@1 as l_suppkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
